   "amendmentRef": "AIDCF-007A-AMD-002",
   "applicability": "Applies to every assessment that requests evidence from others.",
   "assessmentCriteria": [
    "Every Evidence Requirement in the sample has an assigned source owner.",
    "Every request has an evidence request record with request date, due date, response and status.",
    "Overdue requests were escalated to the capability owner.",
