   "applicability": "Applies to every organisation operating or assuring an in-scope Capability Instance; for providers, applies to documents the provider makes available under contract.",
   "assessmentCriteria": [
    "A register exists listing each in-scope policy, standard, procedure and runbook with level, parent, owner, scope and approval status.",
    "Every document below policy level traces to an approved, current parent.",
    "Policy-level documents cover at minimum assurance, risk, change, incident, safety of work, information security, evidence and provider management for the in-scope capability.",
