   "name": "OOB Resilience",
   "amendmentRef": "AIDCF-007A-AMD-002",
   "applicability": "Applies to every site supporting in-scope outcomes. Where OOB is provided by a colocation operator, responsibilities shall be explicit under DEP-018.",
   "assessmentCriteria": [
    "OOB design states switching, power source and autonomy, upstream paths and authentication fallback.",
    "Dependency analysis shows the OOB network does not depend on the production fabric, production DNS/identity or the primary WAN, or each dependency is mitigated.",
